<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:18.0pt;padding-right:18.0pt;">   5   </span></span>
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.7" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#ECECEC;">
