<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:18.0pt;padding-right:18.0pt;">   6,905   </span></span>
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-left:18.0pt;padding-right:18.0pt;">   - Negative Samples   </span>
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:18.0pt;padding-right:18.0pt;">   8,296   </span></span>
