<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation of text-to-image generation ability on Gen-Eval benchmark.</span> “Generation Only” stands for an image generation model, and “Unified Multimodal” denotes a model that has both understanding and generation capabilities. <sup id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S4.T2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗</span></sup> means we report the
reproducing results using the official Github repository and checkpoint. Our approach boosts BAGEL-7B by 5% absolute gains, and the performance with 7B parameters achieve comparable with a 12B state-of-the-art generation-only model FLUX.1-dev. </figcaption>
</figure>
